## TypeScript Source Inventory Contract

The TypeScript source inventory contract keeps every `TypeScript/**/*.ts` source file listed in `Tools/check/adlaire-design-contracts.json` and check-covered by one of the source registries: the CSS compiler registry, generated JavaScript pair contract, UI interaction contract metadata, UI component contract metadata, or editor runtime module registry.

## Documentation Structure Contract

The Documentation structure contract keeps `README.md` as the compact language gateway, `Docs/README.en.md` and `Docs/README.ja.md` as aligned reader guides, `Docs/Master_Spec` as the overall source of truth, and `Docs/Document_Index` as the repository inventory. This index names locations and ownership boundaries; it does not redefine contracts owned by `Docs/Master_Spec`.

